# Shared tool configuration (DEL-TOOL-003). `just sync-config` in every
# repository copies these files from a pinned commit of this repository;
# `just check-config` fails when a copy differs. Repositories may add stricter
# settings only in their own files (e.g. eslint.config.js importing
# eslint.shared.js), never by editing a copy.
#
# file                        destination in the repository     repository kinds
ruff.toml                     ruff.toml                         all
mypy.ini                      mypy.ini                          all
.markdownlint-cli2.yaml       .markdownlint-cli2.yaml           all
.pre-commit-config.yaml       .pre-commit-config.yaml           all
.editorconfig                 .editorconfig                     all
pull_request_template.md      .github/pull_request_template.md  all
.prettierrc.json              frontend/.prettierrc.json         core
eslint.shared.js              frontend/eslint.shared.js         core
stylelint.shared.js           frontend/stylelint.shared.js      core
